  "description": "DeeplySixties is an elegant serif typeface inspired by the classic aesthetic of the 1960s. Featuring high-contrast strokes and sharp, distinctive serifs, this font provides a crisp texture on both digital screens and physical pages. It exudes an aura of quiet luxury, balanced proportions, and rhythmic flow, making it command attention naturally.\nWith 6 versatile styles ranging from Regular to Bold Italic, DeeplySixties is an ideal choice for editorial designs, high-end magazines, journals, book covers, and sophisticated brand identity systems. It is also perfect for digital interfaces, headers, and hero sections where a touch of timeless heritage and intellectual rigor is required to elevate the overall design experience.\nWhat’s Included:\n– Six Full character set (Uppercase & Lowercase)\n– Numbers, Punctuation, and Symbols\n– Multilingual Support\n– OTF and TTF formats",
  "fullDescription": "<p>DeeplySixties is an elegant serif typeface inspired by the classic aesthetic of the 1960s. Featuring high-contrast strokes and sharp, distinctive serifs, this font provides a crisp texture on both digital screens and physical pages. It exudes an aura of quiet luxury, balanced proportions, and rhythmic flow, making it command attention naturally.</p>\n<p>With 6 versatile styles ranging from Regular to Bold Italic, DeeplySixties is an ideal choice for editorial designs, high-end magazines, journals, book covers, and sophisticated brand identity systems. It is also perfect for digital interfaces, headers, and hero sections where a touch of timeless heritage and intellectual rigor is required to elevate the overall design experience.</p>\n<p>What’s Included:<br>\n– Six Full character set (Uppercase &amp; Lowercase)<br>\n– Numbers, Punctuation, and Symbols<br>\n– Multilingual Support<br>\n– OTF and TTF formats</p>",
